			"meer_1yellow": {
				"genders": [50,50],
				"growth": "mediumslow",
				"dexentry": "The Meerca is super fast and really small which makes it very difficult to grab hold of. Meercas are talented pranksters who are very rarely caught. If your Neopet complains that someone has stolen its fuzzle, a Meerca is probably to blame.",
